    <h2>How We Begin</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--gray-light); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.85; max-width: 680px; margin-top: 1.25rem;">
      OpenOwls was born in the summer of 2026 — not from a grant, a committee, or a strategic plan,
      but from a single conversation and a tight deadline. Our founder, Professor X-Owl, saw a gap
      between what students were learning in class and what the industry was demanding, and decided
      to do something about it. What started as a simple question — <em>can AI help us work faster
      and better?</em> — became a movement. This is where it began.
    </p>
  </section>

