        <div class="section-label">Our Founder</div>
        <h2>Professor X-Owl</h2>
        <span class="prof-tagline"><em>&ldquo;Mind. Code. Create the Future.&rdquo;</em></span>
        <p class="prof-bio">
          Little is known about the enigmatic Professor X-Owl &mdash; and that is precisely how he prefers it.
          Rumor has it he possesses rare <strong>telegraphic abilities</strong>, capable of sensing a
          student&rsquo;s hidden potential before they&rsquo;ve written a single line of code.
        </p>
        <p class="prof-bio">
          Before founding OpenOwls, he is said to have run a secretive school for gifted individuals &mdash;
          students with extraordinary abilities who needed only the right mentor to unlock them.
          The school&rsquo;s motto: <em>&ldquo;Every owl has a superpower waiting to be unleashed.&rdquo;</em>
        </p>
        <p class="prof-bio">
          Some in the cryptography world whisper that Professor X-Owl may also be the mysterious
          <strong>Hootoshi Nakaowlto</strong> &mdash; the pseudonymous mind behind a certain revolutionary
          decentralized ledger that changed the world&rsquo;s relationship with trust and money.
          He has neither confirmed nor denied this. He simply adjusts his glasses, taps his temple, and smiles.
        </p>
        <p class="prof-bio">
          Today, Professor X-Owl leads OpenOwls with one mission: to find the next generation of
          AI-powered engineers at Temple University and give them the tools, the projects, and the
          community to build things that matter.
        </p>
        <div class="prof-quote">
          &ldquo;I don&rsquo;t teach students to write code. I teach them to think like builders &mdash; and then I get out of their way.&rdquo;
          <cite>&mdash; Professor X-Owl</cite>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
